/ This Slim comment is not rendered
/! This HTML comment is rendered

- items = [{name: "Alpha", price: 10}, {name: "Beta", price: 20}]
- if items.any?
  table
    - items.each do |item|
      tr
        td = item[:name]
        td = number_to_currency(item[:price])
- else
  p No items found.

== raw yield

p
  | Hello, #{current_user.name}!
  | Visit #{link_to "home", root_path} to continue.
